# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Email delivery for the Contact form and the Portfolio Rating.
# Powered by Web3Forms (free, no backend required).
#
# HOW TO ENABLE REAL EMAIL DELIVERY:
#   1. Visit https://web3forms.com
#   2. Enter your email (ch.charan2006@gmail.com) to get an Access Key.
#   3. Copy this file to ".env" and paste your key below.
#   4. Run: npm run build
#
# Until a valid key is set, the Contact form safely falls back to
# opening the visitor's email client (mailto) instead of silently
# pretending a message was sent.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
